    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d232">

                <pb facs="0668" n="546" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg546"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mutsu to Mr.
                            Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-01-31"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 31, 1889</date>.
                        (Received February 1.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    note of the 29th instant, in which you inform me that the President has approved
                    the suggestion that the fund for the reward of the inhabitants of Tanegashima
                    for their humane treatment of the survivors of the crew of the American bark <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Cashmere</hi> shall be employed for educational purposes
                    in that island; and in which you further advise me that the United States
                    minister at Tokio will be instructed fully to acquaint His Imperial Majesty’s
                    Government with the subject, to the end that steps may be immediately taken for
                    the employment of the funds in the manner indicated.</p>
                <p>I have already informed my Government of the disposition which would probably be
                    made of this fund, in accordance with the suggestion of the governor of
                    Kagoshima Ken through the United States consul at Nagasaki; and I feel assured
                    that they will highly appreciate this additional evidence of the desire of the
                    United States to strengthen the bonds of friendship and mutual esteem which
                    happily exist between our countries.</p>
                <p>I remain, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Mutsu.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
